1
00:00:00,023 --> 00:00:02,193
(Sheldon:)Incidentally, one can get beaten up
in school...

2
00:00:02,359 --> 00:00:05,239
(Sheldon:)...simply
by referring to oneself as "one."

3
00:00:06,363 --> 00:00:09,533
(Sheldon:)I'm making English muffins.
Would you like an English muffin?

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,950
(Penny:)Oh, thanks, I'm not hungry.

5
00:00:11,118 --> 00:00:15,538
FYI, my noise-canceling headphones
proved ineffective last night.

6
00:00:16,999 --> 00:00:19,669
(Penny:)-Yeah, sorry about that.
-As a native Texan, I must say...

7
00:00:19,835 --> 00:00:23,255
...I've never heard the phrase "yeehaw"
used in quite that context.

8
00:00:24,256 --> 00:00:26,086
(Penny:)Oh, God.

9
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,630
"Oh, God."

10
00:00:28,802 --> 00:00:31,552
(Sheldon:)That I've heard on multiple occasions.

11
00:00:35,809 --> 00:00:39,649
In what universe is that "lightly toasted"?

12
00:00:42,649 --> 00:00:45,149
(Sheldon:)This has to be the worst day of my life.

13
00:00:46,903 --> 00:00:48,573
(Sheldon:)Good morning, Leonard.

14
00:00:48,739 --> 00:00:50,949
(Leonard:)How many times
have I asked you not to do that?

15
00:00:51,408 --> 00:00:56,018
(Sheldon:)Counting this instance?
Three hundred seventeen.

